  "scope": "All32768 ordinary saved FCADR words are qualified at four original origins: CDUTRIG, CD*TR*G, transformed VLOAD/pendingRVQ, and CALCSMSC. RVQ enters GOTO+4 and skips erasable classification, so even fixed banks0/1 are valid. The source return restores EB from BANKSET, normalizes raw L, derives FB/BB/BANKSET/LOC/INTBIT15 and POLISH, and reaches original NEWOPS06070. CALCSMSC uses bank10/INTBIT15=0. Erasable indirect return is outside this fixed-entry contract."
